/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The "Let Us Dream Community Conference 2025" at Stella Maris College, Chennai, will take place on November 22, 2025. This one-day event focuses on building resilience and community empowerment through keynote speeches, interactive workshops, and collaborative activities. Attendees will hear inspiring stories, engage in discussions on education, health, and social service, and participate in group activities designed to foster reflection and idea generation. The conference highlights changemakers and promotes networking among community members, educators, and organizations dedicated to social improvement. Join this impactful event at Stella Maris College to contribute to a stronger, more resilient community.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
