/E (The Let Us Dream Annual Community Conference is an upcoming event happening on 29 November 2025 at Nodal Office, CHRIST \(Deemed to be University\), Trivandrum. The conference will bring together changemakers and community leaders for a day of keynotes, hands-on workshops, and collaborative activities focused on building resilient, healthy communities through dialogue, sharing, and local action. Attendees can expect networking, inspiring stories, panel discussions, and opportunities to co-create practical solutions for social, educational, and health challenges.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
